<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Tozluoglu et al. (2019) Dev. Cell & Sui et al. (2018) Nat. Commun. Drosophila wing imaginal disc planar differential growth, basal ECM dome & H/N, H/H, H/P hinge folding — MorphoEval overall 54.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py` (overall weighted score: 56.8/100). The v1 script implements the analytic bilayer pouch dome curvature formula and a 64 h to 96 h AEL wild-type timecourse backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_049_wing_disc_dome_folding.lean`, but relies on a closed-form Gaussian-cleft + parabolic-dome ansatz instead of L-BFGS-B minimization of the 2D sagittal apico-basal bilayer morphoelastic energy functional, omits the uniform-growth unpinned buckling control, Collagenase / vkg-RNAi basal ECM ablation control, JAK/STAT hinge overgrowth, and dysfusion/omb perturbations, and does not segment the vendored Drosophila wing disc micrograph (`drosophila_wing_disc_specimen.jpg`). Overall 54.2/100 (faithfulness 48.1, reproducibility 68.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 36, Parameter expressivity 50, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 76, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/wing_disc_dome_folding_comparison.png: rendered output of 2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py at e93f00e, image/png, 197921 B, 1750×1190 px, artifact_sha256 93ecf4fcbea8292a4d9494e844afb20353ec312ead5e4de19cda0ffd4c21976e (sha256 93ecf4fcbea8292a4d9494e844afb20353ec312ead5e4de19cda0ffd4c21976e), spec_fingerprint bcd73f8cd05a798cd28d5d8699091decf2998046dc76356ac2ad3f948db43ac8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: bcd73f8cd05a798cd28d5d8699091decf2998046dc76356ac2ad3f948db43ac8; artifact_sha256: 93ecf4fcbea8292a4d9494e844afb20353ec312ead5e4de19cda0ffd4c21976e; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/wing_disc_dome_folding/drosophila_wing_disc_specimen.jpg=b523296d0ee292e1..., datasets/wing_disc_dome_folding/scout_manifest.json=0f2a2d1d54a8d262..., datasets/wing_disc_dome_folding/wing_disc_dome_folding_reference.json=c4c99a6cca181df7...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement all 5 experimental and genetic perturbation conditions: wild-type heterogeneous growth + stiff basal ECM + local remodeling, uniform proliferation unpinned buckling control across replicate seeds, Collagenase / vkg-RNAi basal ECM removal flattening control (mu_BM -> 0), JAK/STAT (Upd) hinge overgrowth, and dysfusion / omb loss of local tension/ECM softening.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the closed-form 1D Gaussian ansatz with a 2D sagittal apico-basal bilayer morphoelastic cross-section solver (L-BFGS-B minimization of stretching + bending + basal ECM tether energy under multiplicative growth F = F_e * F_g) from 64 h to 96 h AEL.",
        "remediation needed: Segment the vendored CC BY-SA 2.5 Drosophila melanogaster wing imaginal disc micrograph (`drosophila_wing_disc_specimen.jpg`) to extract wing disc contours, pouch/hinge/notum reporter zones, and empirical H/N, H/H, and H/P fold transition coordinates, and enforce runtime SHA-256 verification." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.42e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
